# Dashboard-authored data: assignees, points, notes, parks, advances and
# confirmations. It holds names, so it is not committed by default - but it is
# NOT regenerable, and a team should share it. /setup asks. Sharing it is
# a deliberate decision to record in an ADR.
.management/board.db
.management/board.db-journal

# Commit log written by the post-commit hook. Append-only local evidence.
.management/commits.jsonl

# NOTE: .idea/ is deliberately NOT ignored. In this repo it is the idea vault,
# not JetBrains config, and it must be committed.
